{"title":"Jeremy","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>Jeremy has 1 apple, he gets another apple, how many apples does he have?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Jeremy&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/9/349b6b8a00581fb06095c20113d8fa49f3f5cf9c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 + 1 = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"73\" height=\"13\" />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"background:#ffdddd; width:60%; border:2px solid #aa0000; margin:auto; text-align:center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding:10px;\">\n<p><b>This page has been proposed for <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Wiki:Deletion_policy\" title=\"AoPS Wiki:Deletion policy\">deletion</a>.</b> Reason: <b>lol why</b>\n</p>\n<hr style=\"border:1px solid #aa0000;\" />\n<p><small>\n<b>Note to sysops:</b> Before deleting, please review: • <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Special:WhatLinksHere/Jeremy\" title=\"Special:WhatLinksHere/Jeremy\">What links here</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Talk:Jeremy&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Talk:Jeremy (page does not exist)\">Discussion page</a> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Jeremy&amp;action=history\">Edit history</a>\n</small>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018092142\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.012 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.020 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 16/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 673/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser